{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>VisionCut 是專為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的專業影片剪輯工具，適合想進行多軌剪接、調色、字幕與音效處理的創作者。原價 US $0.99，現在<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-8.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多軌剪輯與專業調色</h2>\n<p>內建多軌時間軸，可將影片、音訊、子母畫面、文字、圖形與貼紙分軌處理，支援精準裁剪、速度曲線、關鍵影格及無限復原。調色提供色輪、曝光與自訂 LUT，音訊可錄製旁白、降噪、自動配樂與一鍵移除靜音，並可生成裝置端字幕及輸出 4K HEVC。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1178\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2868x1320bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1178\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2868x1320bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1178\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2868x1320bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1178\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2868x1320bb-3-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1178\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2868x1320bb-4-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1178\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2868x1320bb-5-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：VisionCut: Pro Video Editor</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/visioncut-pro-video-editor/id6762552307?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:02.910390+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T02:19:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:34.805447+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:46.711267+00:00","content_hash":"02e52240aced2c923c2441472cc8cc692a90d0174799a758a38b2b7c4a8c531c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}